  "definition": "Regulatory Technology (RegTech) applies digital tools\u2014including AI, machine learning, and distributed ledger systems\u2014to automate and streamline regulatory compliance processes such as KYC/AML checks, audit trail generation, risk reporting, and consent management. In spatial-computing and metaverse contexts, RegTech addresses jurisdiction-sensitive data flows, real-time content moderation, and smart-contract-based enforcement of platform governance rules.",
